{
  "name": "Helped - WhatsApp Broadcast Sender",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "hook": 0, "maxResults": 1 },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": { "parameters": { "hook": { "data": { "editable": "true" }, "label": "Helped WhatsApp Broadcast Sender" } } },
        "notes": "Create this webhook after import. Save its URL as the Worker secret MAKE_WHATSAPP_BROADCAST_WEBHOOK_URL. The Worker sends only recipients whose documented consent is currently active."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0, "name": "Campaign or consenting test message" } },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 3,
              "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": { "array": "{{1.recipients}}" },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 580, "y": -140 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Run scenario sequentially. Recommended volume is low; add Tools > Sleep for 1–2 seconds after each WAHA call." },
              "expect": [{ "name": "array", "type": "array", "label": "Server-validated campaign recipients", "spec": [
                { "name": "recipientId", "type": "text", "label": "Database recipient ID" },
                { "name": "phone", "type": "text", "label": "International E.164 phone" },
                { "name": "message", "type": "text", "label": "Personalized text" }
              ] }]
            },
            {
              "id": 4,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://YOUR-DEPLOYED-DOMAIN/api/whatsapp-broadcast/automation/claim/{{3.recipientId}}",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [{ "name": "x-whatsapp-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WHATSAPP_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }],
                "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": ""
              },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 850, "y": -140 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Atomically claim this one pending recipient. The database rejects claims after opt-out, pause/cancel, duplicate successful send, or three attempts." }
            },
            {
              "id": 5,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "filter": { "name": "Recipient claimed", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{4.data.claimed}}", "o": "boolean:equal", "b": "true" }]] },
              "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://YOUR-WAHA-HOST/api/sendText",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [{ "name": "X-Api-Key", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WAHA_API_KEY" }],
                "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json",
                "data": "{\n  \"session\": \"default\",\n  \"chatId\": \"{{replace(4.data.phone; \"+\"; \"\")}}@c.us\",\n  \"text\": \"{{escapeJSON(4.data.message)}}\"\n}"
              },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1130, "y": -140 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Use an authenticated HTTPS WAHA endpoint reachable from Make. Localhost is not reachable from Make. WAHA API: POST /api/sendText; HTTP acceptance means sent/queued, not delivered or read." }
            },
            {
              "id": 6,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://YOUR-DEPLOYED-DOMAIN/api/whatsapp-broadcast/automation/delivery-result",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "name": "x-whatsapp-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WHATSAPP_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }],
                "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json",
                "data": "{\n  \"recipientId\": \"{{4.data.recipientId}}\",\n  \"campaignId\": \"{{4.data.campaignId}}\",\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\n  \"wahaMessageId\": \"{{5.data.id}}\"\n}"
              },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1420, "y": -140 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Successful sends are idempotent. Never retry a recipient after a successful callback." }
            }
          ],
          "filter": { "name": "Campaign dispatch", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{1.scenario}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "whatsapp_broadcast" }]] }
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 7,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://YOUR-DEPLOYED-DOMAIN/api/whatsapp-broadcast/automation/authorize-test",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "name": "x-whatsapp-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WHATSAPP_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }],
                "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json",
                "data": "{\n  \"agencyId\": \"{{1.agencyId}}\",\n  \"contactId\": \"{{1.contactId}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{1.phone}}\"\n}"
              },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 580, "y": 160 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Confirm current consent using the private callback before sending a test message." }
            },
            {
              "id": 8,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "filter": { "name": "Test contact is still opted in", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{7.data.canSend}}", "o": "boolean:equal", "b": "true" }]] },
              "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true },
              "mapper": { "url": "https://YOUR-WAHA-HOST/api/sendText", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [{ "name": "X-Api-Key", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WAHA_API_KEY" }], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"session\": \"default\",\n  \"chatId\": \"{{replace(1.phone; \"+\"; \"\")}}@c.us\",\n  \"text\": \"{{escapeJSON(1.message)}}\"\n}" },
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 160 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Send test message only after backend permission verification." }
            }
          ],
          "filter": { "name": "Consenting test message", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{1.scenario}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "whatsapp_test_message" }]] }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": { "roundtrips": 1, "maxErrors": 3, "autoCommit": true, "autoCommitTriggerLast": true, "sequential": true, "slots": null, "confidential": true, "dataloss": false, "dlq": false, "freshVariables": false },
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "zone": "eu1.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "After import create the custom webhook and set its URL as the Worker secret MAKE_WHATSAPP_BROADCAST_WEBHOOK_URL. Set WHATSAPP_AUTOMATION_SECRET on the Worker and in the two callback header mappings in Make.",
      "Configure WAHA with an API key and an authenticated HTTPS tunnel or secure cloud address; set the X-Api-Key mapping in Make. WAHA cannot be reached at Windows localhost from Make. The chat ID format is international digits plus @c.us, and the request uses session=default.",
      "In Make settings set sequential processing ON. Add Tools > Sleep for 1–2 seconds after each recipient send to avoid simultaneous delivery and reduce account restrictions. Start with one opted-in test contact.",
      "Add an error handler on WAHA HTTP failures that posts status=failed to delivery-result only for definitive errors. Do not automatically retry a timeout with unknown outcome. Configure retry cap to three and never replay success callbacks.",
      "WAHA is an unofficial WhatsApp Web integration and may cause account restrictions. Prefer the official WhatsApp Business Platform for production."
    ]
  }
}
